     <item row="2" column="1">
      <widget class="QComboBox" name="template_format">
       <property name="toolTip">
        <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shapefile: its .shp, .dbf, .shx, .prj, .cpg and the .qml of the QGIS form, legend and default values. GeoJSON, KML and KMZ: with one example site of child project 99999, delete it. The Date of KML and KMZ is a text YYYY_MM_DD.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
